    verb4   (rv1)    10.462    0.833                     10.462    0.178
    verb6   (rv1)    10.462    0.833                     10.462    0.101
    intrcpt          20.477    3.070                      1.000    1.000
    slope             1.837    0.298                      1.000    1.000

Group 2 [1]:

                   Estimate  Std.err  Z-value  P(>|z|)   Std.lv  Std.all
Variances:
    verb1            13.644    3.812                     13.644    0.524
    verb2             7.585    2.449                      7.585    0.341
    verb4             9.426    3.040                      9.426    0.334
    verb6            36.984   10.499                     36.984    0.568
    intercept        12.403    4.375                      1.000    1.000
    slope             0.243    0.468                      1.000    1.000

