Hi Ya,

The issue is with the specification of the 3-forms missing data design. You need to specify the missing pattern as a separate object (using the miss function) and then pass that object to the miss argument in the sim function. Fro an example of this, see example 9 at simsem.org <http://simsem.org>

Alex

